WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:06.864
"Why are you here, Rocket Girl?" Dr. Odd asked.

2
00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:10.465
Roxy didn't answer. She was shocked.

3
00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:13.113
She was so far from Earth.

4
00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:18.099
And Dr. Odd, one of the worst villains from Metro City, was here too!

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.558
Cozlin looked from Roxy to Dr. Odd.

6
00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:23.979
"You two know each other?"

7
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:29.791
Roxy nodded. "His name is Dr. Odd, and he's evil."

8
00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:34.252
"I'm not evil anymore!" Dr. Odd shouted.

9
00:00:34.253 --> 00:00:37.979
"A judge released me from prison for good behavior!"

10
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.860
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

11
00:00:39.861 --> 00:00:44.386
"Good behavior? What did you do that was so good?"

12
00:00:44.387 --> 00:00:46.998
Dr. Odd folded his arms.

13
00:00:46.999 --> 00:00:51.169
"I taught technology classes to the other prisoners.

14
00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.505
I helped them get a decent education."

15
00:00:54.506 --> 00:00:58.949
Roxy snorted. "What were the technology classes about?

16
00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:02.257
How to take over a planet with robots?"

17
00:01:02.258 --> 00:01:05.970
"What are you talking about?" Dr. Odd asked.

18
00:01:05.971 --> 00:01:09.517
"Groon used to be a nice planet," Roxy said.

19
00:01:09.518 --> 00:01:13.129
"And it looks like you turned it into some sort of robot planet.

20
00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.615
You did this to other planets too!"

21
00:01:15.616 --> 00:01:20.148
"Yeah!" Cozlin said. "My planet!"

22
00:01:20.149 --> 00:01:23.339
"I didn't do that!" Dr. Odd shouted.

23
00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:27.744
He glared at Cozlin. "Who are you anyway?"

24
00:01:27.745 --> 00:01:32.637
Cozlin folded her arms. "I'm Kid Comet."

25
00:01:32.638 --> 00:01:35.654
Dr. Odd pointed to the sphere behind him.

26
00:01:35.655 --> 00:01:41.533
"That's my moon. I was living peacefully on it—alone.

27
00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:48.050
A magnetic force took control of it and brought me here.

28
00:01:48.051 --> 00:01:51.038
Now I'm stuck here!"

29
00:01:51.039 --> 00:01:56.772
Roxy narrowed her eyes. "I don't believe you. You're under arrest!"

30
00:01:56.773 --> 00:01:59.851
"You can't arrest me," the villain said.

31
00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:05.918
"I didn't do anything, and we're millions of light-years from Earth!"

32
00:02:05.919 --> 00:02:10.820
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams shot toward Dr. Odd.

33
00:02:10.821 --> 00:02:17.384
His robot's head snapped shut, hiding him.

34
00:02:17.385 --> 00:02:21.903
Zonk! The robot shot an energy blast at Roxy.

35
00:02:21.904 --> 00:02:26.888
She leaped out of the way as an old spaceship exploded.

36
00:02:26.889 --> 00:02:30.032
Bam! Cozlin punched the robot.

37
00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:34.559
"Gah!" Dr. Odd shouted as the robot nearly lost its balance.

38
00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.294
It spun around, swinging a huge fist toward Cozlin.

39
00:02:38.295 --> 00:02:44.500
"Yikes!" Cozlin landed next to a big rusty wheel.

40
00:02:44.501 --> 00:02:47.983
Zonk! An energy blast flew toward her.

41
00:02:47.984 --> 00:02:51.616
Cozlin quickly stepped through the wheel. Boom!

42
00:02:51.617 --> 00:02:55.612
She appeared on the other side as the blast hit an old rocket.

43
00:02:55.613 --> 00:03:01.200
The robot fired another energy blast. The wheel exploded.

44
00:03:01.201 --> 00:03:03.810
Roxy quickly knocked the robot over.

45
00:03:03.811 --> 00:03:08.001
"Argh!" Dr. Odd shouted.

46
00:03:08.002 --> 00:03:12.421
Pow! Cozlin slammed into the robot's side.

47
00:03:12.422 --> 00:03:15.525
The robot's leg swung, kicking Cozlin.

48
00:03:15.526 --> 00:03:19.883
Cozlin went tumbling into a pile of twisted scrap metal.

49
00:03:19.884 --> 00:03:23.578
As she struggled to get free, an arm grabbed her ankle.

50
00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:29.495
"Ahh!" Cozlin shouted. "This metal is turning into more robots!"

51
00:03:29.496 --> 00:03:32.634
Roxy flew over and grabbed her wrist.

52
00:03:32.635 --> 00:03:36.708
"Don't worry!" Roxy said. "I'll get you out of there!"

53
00:03:36.709 --> 00:03:40.620
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

54
00:03:40.621 --> 00:03:45.102
Slowly the robots and all the metal began to melt.

55
00:03:45.103 --> 00:03:51.193
Roxy pulled Cozlin free as the pile melted into a large puddle.

56
00:03:51.194 --> 00:03:55.342
Roxy looked around. "Where did Dr. Odd go?"

57
00:03:55.343 --> 00:03:58.084
Cozlin shrugged. "I don't know.

58
00:03:58.085 --> 00:04:01.496
But we need to get off this planet and form a new plan.

59
00:04:01.497 --> 00:04:04.574
We can't handle this alone."

60
00:04:04.575 --> 00:04:06.545
Roxy folded her arms.

61
00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:11.564
"Oh! Sounds like Kid Comet needs even more help now."

62
00:04:11.565 --> 00:04:19.823
Cozlin rolled her eyes. "Let's just go back to my ship."

63
00:04:19.824 --> 00:04:24.132
But when they got to the spaceship, both superheroes gasped.

64
00:04:24.133 --> 00:04:33.914
"Your ship!" Roxy said. "The robots took it apart!"

